---
/**
 * A reserved route (D14.7, default 7 of §19.3): one static page per prefix, no logic.
 *
 * These three prefixes are held so that nothing else can ever claim them — the "une route par
 * objet, aucune collision" rule of 07-mecaniques.md §7.11 point 9. `/j/` was the morning measure,
 * given up with D16.9; `/k/` and `/carte#` belonged to "La carte des 89", which got zero votes.
 * One wording for the three: none of them promises anything.
 *
 * The wording obeys voice.md rule 5: no "panne", "erreur", "indisponible", "désolé". Nothing
 * here is broken. And rule 4: it says what the app does, never what it does not guarantee.
 * Impersonal register, because a reserved route is reached by a link (D3.12).
 */
import { t } from '../lib/strings.ts';
---

<h1>{t('reserved.held.title')}</h1>
<p>{t('reserved.held.lead')}</p>
<p><a class="cta" href="/sommaire/">{t('bridge.cta_home')}</a></p>
